<ol class="apps-steps"><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">Pick an app</h3><p class="apps-step-body">Choose Sign in on its site, or run <code class="mono">tunelo login</code> in a terminal.</p></div></li><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">Continue with Google or GitHub</h3><p class="apps-step-body">The account you linked signs you in. The first time, you pick a username.</p></div></li><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">You are back in the app</h3><p class="apps-step-body">Apps from outside Auth Next, such as AI tools, ask for your approval first.</p></div></li></ol>
</section>
<p class="apps-manage" data-id="apps-manage">To see or remove the apps that can access your account, open <a class="link" href="/account">Account</a>.</p></main>
