<div class="app-card-head">
<span class="app-card-icon"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3M8 21h8"/></svg></span>
<div class="app-card-heading"><h3 class="app-card-name">Scribe</h3>
<p class="app-card-meta"><span class="badge badge-neutral">Ứng dụng web</span><span class="mono">scribe.hoandat.com</span></p></div>
</div>
<p class="app-card-desc">Ghi âm và chuyển thành bản chép lời để tìm kiếm, chỉnh sửa.</p>
<div class="app-card-how"><p class="app-card-how-label">Cách đăng nhập</p><p>Chọn Đăng nhập trên trang.</p></div>
<div class="app-card-foot"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://scribe.hoandat.com" data-id="app-open-scribe-web">Mở</a></div>
</li><li class="app-card tone-cyan" data-id="app-miu-web">
<div class="app-card-head">
<span class="app-card-icon"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 10V4l4 3h6l4-3v6a7 7 0 0 1-14 0z"/><path d="M9.5 12h.01M14.5 12h.01M10.5 15.5h3"/></svg></span>
<div class="app-card-heading"><h3 class="app-card-name">Miu World</h3>
<p class="app-card-meta"><span class="badge badge-neutral">Ứng dụng web</span><span class="mono">miu.hoandat.com</span></p></div>
</div>
<p class="app-card-desc">Thế giới 3D vừa chơi vừa học Toán và Tiếng Việt, chơi cùng bạn bè.</p>
<div class="app-card-how"><p class="app-card-how-label">Cách đăng nhập</p><p>Chọn Đăng nhập trên trang hoặc trong app iPhone, Android.</p></div>
<div class="app-card-foot"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://miu.hoandat.com" data-id="app-open-miu-web">Mở</a></div>
</li></ul>
</section>
<section class="apps-section" id="how-sign-in-works" aria-labelledby="apps-steps-title" data-id="apps-steps">
<h2 class="apps-section-title" id="apps-steps-title">Đăng nhập diễn ra thế nào</h2>
<ol class="apps-steps"><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">Chọn một ứng dụng</h3><p class="apps-step-body">Chọn Đăng nhập trên trang của nó, hoặc chạy <code class="mono">tunelo login</code> trong terminal.</p></div></li><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">Tiếp tục với Google hoặc GitHub</h3><p class="apps-step-body">Tài khoản bạn đã liên kết sẽ đăng nhập cho bạn. Lần đầu, bạn chọn một tên đăng nhập.</p></div></li><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">Quay lại ứng dụng</h3><p class="apps-step-body">Ứng dụng bên ngoài Auth Next, như công cụ AI, sẽ hỏi bạn đồng ý trước.</p></div></li></ol>
</section>
<p class="apps-manage" data-id="apps-manage">Để xem hoặc gỡ các ứng dụng đang có quyền vào tài khoản, mở trang <a class="link" href="/account">Tài khoản</a>.</p></main>
<footer class="page-foot container"><nav class="lang-switch" aria-label="Ngôn ngữ" data-id="lang-switch"><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=en&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="en" hreflang="en" data-id="lang-en">English</a><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=zh-CN&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="zh-CN" hreflang="zh-CN" data-id="lang-zh-CN">中文</a><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=vi&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="vi" hreflang="vi" aria-current="true" data-id="lang-vi">Tiếng Việt</a></nav></footer>
</body>
</html>"
`;

exports[`primary tenant (hoandat.com) is unchanged > renders /apps the same way > zh-CN 1`] = `
"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="description" content="登录账号，管理已关联的应用和设备。">
<title>一个账号，通用所有 Auth Next 应用 · Auth Next</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/inter/400.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/inter/500.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/inter/600.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/400.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/600.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/700.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/tokens.css?v=HASH"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/app.css?v=HASH"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/apps.css?v=HASH">
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-inner container">
<a class="idp-brand" href="/apps" data-id="idp-brand"><span><b>Auth Next</b><span class="idp-brand-suffix"> · 账号</span></span> <span class="badge badge-neutral hide-sm">ISSUER_HOST</span></a>
<nav class="topbar-nav" aria-label="站点导航"><a class="topbar-link" href="/apps" aria-current="page" data-id="nav-home">首页</a><a class="topbar-link" href="/account" data-id="nav-account">账号</a></nav>
</div></header>
<main class="page container portal"><section class="apps-hero" data-id="apps-hero">
<div class="apps-hero-text">
<p class="apps-eyebrow">Auth Next 登录</p>
<h1 class="apps-title">一个账号，通用所有 Auth Next 应用</h1>
<p class="apps-lead">用 Google 或 GitHub 登录一次，即可在下方所有应用中使用同一个账号。</p>
<ul class="apps-trust"><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10"/></svg><span>使用 Google 或 GitHub 登录</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10"/></svg><span>无需创建或记住密码</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10"/></svg><span>由你决定哪些应用可以访问</span></li></ul>
<div class="apps-actions">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/account" data-id="apps-manage-account">管理你的账号</a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#how-sign-in-works" data-id="apps-how">登录如何进行</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="apps-hero-art"><svg class="hub" viewBox="0 0 544 300" role="img" aria-label="通过 Google 或 GitHub 进入你的 Auth Next 账号，即可登录 Localman、Tunelo、Chat、Scribe和Miu World。" data-id="apps-hub">
<path class="hub-line" d="M132 110 C162 110 162 150 192 150"/><path class="hub-flow tone-primary" d="M132 110 C162 110 162 150 192 150"/><path class="hub-line" d="M132 190 C162 190 162 150 192 150"/><path class="hub-flow tone-primary" d="M132 190 C162 190 162 150 192 150"/><path class="hub-line" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 30 392 30"/><path class="hub-flow tone-violet" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 30 392 30"/><path class="hub-line" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 90 392 90"/><path class="hub-flow tone-amber" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 90 392 90"/><path class="hub-line" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 150 392 150"/><path class="hub-flow tone-blue" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 150 392 150"/><path class="hub-line" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 210 392 210"/><path class="hub-flow tone-red" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 210 392 210"/><path class="hub-line" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 270 392 270"/><path class="hub-flow tone-cyan" d="M328 150 C360 150 360 270 392 270"/>
<g class="hub-node">
<rect x="8" y="90" width="124" height="40" rx="10"/>
<svg x="20" y="102" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path class="hub-mark" d="M12.48 10.92v3.28h7.84c-.24 1.84-.853 3.187-1.787 4.133-1.147 1.147-2.933 2.4-6.053 2.4-4.827 0-8.6-3.893-8.6-8.72s3.773-8.72 8.6-8.72c2.6 0 4.507 1.027 5.907 2.347l2.307-2.307C18.747 1.44 16.133 0 12.48 0 5.867 0 .307 5.387.307 12s5.56 12 12.173 12c3.573 0 6.267-1.173 8.373-3.36 2.16-2.16 2.84-5.213 2.84-7.667 0-.76-.053-1.467-.173-2.053H12.48z"/></svg>
<text class="hub-text" x="46" y="115">Google</text>
