  "privacy.purpose.body": "Data is used only to authenticate you, keep you signed in, recover your account, detect unusual access and count, in aggregate, how many people use each app. The service sends no email, shows no ads, and never sells or shares your data or these statistics.",
  "privacy.purpose.title": "How we use it",
  "privacy.rights.body": "On your {account} page you can see and edit your profile, unlink Google, GitHub, Apple or Telegram, and sign out sessions and apps you allowed.",
  "privacy.rights.deleteContact": "To delete your account, contact {email}.",
